{
    "title": "Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 Mobile",
    "description": "Dive into high-octane  FPS action with Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 Mobile. Experience real Call of Duty action with exhilarating PvP Battle Royale and FPS Multiplayer gameplay, featuring Call of Duty: Warzone style combat and weapons with real graphics. Squad up for PvP battles, and fight to win in this Battle Royale mobile game!\r\n\r\nExplore competitive gameplay within the iconic Call of Duty maps, Rebirth Island, Shipment, Shoot House, and Scrapyard. \r\n\r\nUnified Call of Duty on Mobile\r\nPowered by world-class Call of Duty engine, cross-progression technology allows you to take shared weapons, operators, and Battle Pass XP from Call of Duty: Warzone PC and console on mobile. Jump into exciting Battle Royale action and enjoy the FPS multiplayer battle together\u2014 anywhere, anytime. \r\n\r\nMULTIPLAYER ACTION LIKE NEVER SEEN BEFORE\r\nFight for survival in this thrilling Call of Duty game built for mobile. Tactical multiplayer combat, PvP shooting mechanics, and fast team-based action\u2014all at your fingertips. \r\n\r\nGAMEPLAY YOUR WAY \r\nCall of Duty: Warzone Mobile delivers on immersive gameplay with next level graphics and customization. Discover more with Call of Duty\u2019s newest technology, Omnimovement. As featured in Call of Duty: Black Ops 6, Omnimovement is an innovative movement system that introduces the Omni Sprint, Omni Slide, and Omni Dive \u2014 allowing mobile players the freedom to move horizontally in a myriad of directions and to perform as many combat maneuvers as imaginable. From the air to the ground, Omnimovement brings immersive speed, velocity, and reactivity to Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 & Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile. \r\n\r\nWE GOT THE MAPS \r\nReturn to Rebirth Island, deploying to your favorite Points of Interest and wreaking PvP havoc on enemies!\r\n\r\nMORE REAL PLAYERS \r\nShow off your battle skills by surviving and dominating the frontlines against real players in competitive Battle Royale matches. Aim for victory in Rebirth Island. Squad up and build your best tactical team, make the most of the Omnimovement system to win the battle.\r\n\r\nMINIMUM DEVICE SPECIFICATIONS \r\nAndroid 13. More than 4GB RAM. Bindless GPU.\r\n\r\n*Battle Pass cross-progression is shared with certain titles (sold separately). See www.callofduty.com/warzonemobile for more details. \r\n\r\nThis app contains social features that allow you to connect and play with friends. Enable push notifications to be informed when exciting events and new content are taking place in the game. You can choose whether to utilize these features. Requires a persistent internet connection (network fees may apply). Age restrictions apply. Allows players to communicate. Includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items. \r\n\r\nRequires acceptance of Activision\u2019s privacy policy and software terms of use. Please visit https://www.activision.com/legal/privacy-policy to view Activision\u2019s privacy policy \r\n\r\n\u00a9 2024 Activision Publishing, Inc. ACTIVISION, CALL OF DUTY, and CALL OF DUTY WARZONE are trademarks of Activision Publishing, Inc. Google Play is a trademark of Google LLC. All other trademarks and trade names are the property of their respective owners. \r\n\r\nPlease contact customer service if you encounter any problems: CODWarzoneMobile@activision.com  \r\nPlease see terms and conditions here: https://www.callofduty.com/warzonemobile/warzonemobile-terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Dive into high-octane  FPS action with Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 Mobile. Experience real Call of Duty action with exhilarating PvP Battle Royale and FPS Multiplayer gameplay, featuring Call of Duty: Warzone style combat and weapons with real graphics. Squad up for PvP battles, and fight to win in this Battle Royale mobile game!<br><br>Explore competitive gameplay within the iconic Call of Duty maps, Rebirth Island, Shipment, Shoot House, and Scrapyard. <br><br>Unified Call of Duty on Mobile<br>Powered by world-class Call of Duty engine, cross-progression technology allows you to take shared weapons, operators, and Battle Pass XP from Call of Duty: Warzone PC and console on mobile. Jump into exciting Battle Royale action and enjoy the FPS multiplayer battle together\u2014 anywhere, anytime. <br><br>MULTIPLAYER ACTION LIKE NEVER SEEN BEFORE<br>Fight for survival in this thrilling Call of Duty game built for mobile. Tactical multiplayer combat, PvP shooting mechanics, and fast team-based action\u2014all at your fingertips. <br><br>GAMEPLAY YOUR WAY <br>Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile delivers on immersive gameplay with next level graphics and customization. Discover more with Call of Duty\u2019s newest technology, Omnimovement. As featured in Call of Duty: Black Ops 6, Omnimovement is an innovative movement system that introduces the Omni Sprint, Omni Slide, and Omni Dive \u2014 allowing mobile players the freedom to move horizontally in a myriad of directions and to perform as many combat maneuvers as imaginable. From the air to the ground, Omnimovement brings immersive speed, velocity, and reactivity to Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 &amp; Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile. <br><br>WE GOT THE MAPS <br>Return to Rebirth Island, deploying to your favorite Points of Interest and wreaking PvP havoc on enemies!<br><br>MORE REAL PLAYERS <br>Show off your battle skills by surviving and dominating the frontlines against real players in competitive Battle Royale matches. Aim for victory in Rebirth Island. Squad up and build your best tactical team, make the most of the Omnimovement system to win the battle.<br><br>MINIMUM DEVICE SPECIFICATIONS <br>Android 13. More than 4GB RAM. Bindless GPU.<br><br>*Battle Pass cross-progression is shared with certain titles (sold separately). See www.callofduty.com/warzonemobile for more details. <br><br>This app contains social features that allow you to connect and play with friends. Enable push notifications to be informed when exciting events and new content are taking place in the game. You can choose whether to utilize these features. Requires a persistent internet connection (network fees may apply). Age restrictions apply. Allows players to communicate. Includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items. <br><br>Requires acceptance of Activision\u2019s privacy policy and software terms of use. Please visit https://www.activision.com/legal/privacy-policy to view Activision\u2019s privacy policy <br><br>\u00a9 2024 Activision Publishing, Inc. ACTIVISION, CALL OF DUTY, and CALL OF DUTY WARZONE are trademarks of Activision Publishing, Inc. Google Play is a trademark of Google LLC. All other trademarks and trade names are the property of their respective owners. <br><br>Please contact customer service if you encounter any problems: CODWarzoneMobile@activision.com  <br>Please see terms and conditions here: https://www.callofduty.com/warzonemobile/warzonemobile-terms",
